note as BIZ_diagram_28_telemetry
  BUSINESS PURPOSE
  Tracks application journeys for security, product and commercial analysis
  while separating mandatory security audit from optional/regulated analytics.
  Terms acceptance is evidence of disclosure, not a universal legal basis.
end note

